//@version=6
// Blave Agent export template — TradingView Pine Script v6
// Template:  sma_cross_long_short
// Logic:     long while SMA fast > SMA slow, short while SMA fast < SMA slow — always in the market, flips directly.
//            For a Blave four-threshold long/short with a flat band (strategy-code.md), keep the four branches at the
//            bottom of the orders block and delete the two flip branches.
// Blave ref: examples/btc_sma_cross/strategy.py with signal -1.0 on the death-cross side
// Chart:     set symbol and timeframe by hand; shorting needs a symbol the user can short (perp / futures / margin).
// Costs:     commission 0.05 % per side = Blave FEE 0.0005; slippage 0 like Blave.
// Not compiled by Blave Agent. Add to a chart, open the Strategy Tester, check the trade list before use.
strategy("Blave: SMA Cross Long/Short", overlay = true, initial_capital = 10000, default_qty_type = strategy.percent_of_equity, default_qty_value = 100, commission_type = strategy.commission.percent, commission_value = 0.05, slippage = 0, pyramiding = 1, process_orders_on_close = false, calc_on_every_tick = false)

// --- inputs ---
int fastLen = input.int(45, "Fast SMA", minval = 1)
int slowLen = input.int(100, "Slow SMA", minval = 2)

// --- signal ---
float smaFast = ta.sma(close, fastLen)
float smaSlow = ta.sma(close, slowLen)
bool longState  = smaFast > smaSlow        // Python: signal[SMA_F > SMA_S] = 1.0
bool shortState = smaFast < smaSlow        // Python: signal[SMA_F < SMA_S] = -1.0

// --- orders ---
// strategy.entry() in the opposite direction reverses an open position in one call (close + open, one fill).
// position_size <= 0 guards the long branch so a repeated long state is a no-op; same for the short side.
if longState and strategy.position_size <= 0
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
if shortState and strategy.position_size >= 0
    strategy.entry("S", strategy.short)

// Four-threshold variant (flat band between exits): replace the two branches above with these four,
// where enterLong / exitLong / enterShort / exitShort are the bool series built from BUY_TH / SELL_TH / SHORT_TH / COVER_TH.
// if exitLong and strategy.position_size > 0
//     strategy.close("L")
// if exitShort and strategy.position_size < 0
//     strategy.close("S")
// if enterLong and strategy.position_size <= 0
//     strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
// if enterShort and strategy.position_size >= 0
//     strategy.entry("S", strategy.short)

// --- plots ---
plot(smaFast, "SMA fast", color = color.blue)
plot(smaSlow, "SMA slow", color = color.orange)
